<p>Chhattisgarh is a large state with its specialists unevenly spread. Raipur has a wide choice, Bilaspur and Durg have a reasonable one, and the northern and southern districts have far fewer. Most guides written for the state ignore that completely and name a single best doctor. This one takes the opposite approach: it tells you what good care looks like, where it is realistically available, and when travelling is actually worth it.</p>

<div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF5F0, #FFE6D6); padding: 24px 28px; border-radius: 16px; margin: 30px 0; border: 1px solid #FFCDA8;">
